'''Helmut Krabbe''' (ヤドカリー, ''Yadokarī'') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

