==Enemy==
Helmut Krabbe is a moderately strong enemy with a fast attack rate and a 100% chance to [[Survive|survive]] a lethal strike. As usual, meatshields are good here, as he won't be much of a threat if you have a steady stream of them.

==Strategy==
Helmut Krabbe isn't too much of a threat, even without any [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]]. To kill him, use meatshields, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]. If you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], use him as well. Once he survives a lethal strike, nearly anything can finish him off.

He doesn't appear often outside of Into the Future, and when he does it's unlikely that he'll pose much of a threat, if any.

