==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Yadokarī (ヤドカリー), is a play on the Japanese word for "hermit crab", ''yadokari'' (やどかり or ヤドカリ).
*In the Spanish translation of the game, Helmut Krabbe is named ''Hermitaño tacaño'' (Stingy hermit), possibly being a reference to [[wikia:Spongebob:Eugene H. Krabs|Mr. Krabs]], who is infamous for his greed.

